abstract: "CLISA Deployment & Intelligent Infrastructure Suite is an automated, deterministic orchestration and hardware acceleration framework for Linux systems (Wayland/Sway, Btrfs subvolumes, IOMMU GPU passthrough, and intelligent power/thermal governance)."
